OL,3,GNEWSAPolice drones tackle rooftop urban
OL,4,Aexploring trend                        
OL,6,FUrban exploring, or urbexing, sees     
OL,7,Fyoung people climb on to rooftops and  
OL,8,Fget into empty buildings, often filming
OL,9,Fthemselves for social media. The force 
OL,10,Fsaid it had increased in the county in 
OL,11,Frecent months.                         
